@host = http://localhost:5137
@code = learning-link

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Create a short link
POST {{host}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core",
  "customAlias": "{{code}}",
  "expiresAt": null
}

### List links
GET {{host}}/api/links?page=1&pageSize=20

### Get one link
GET {{host}}/api/links/{{code}}

### Follow the short link and record a click
GET {{host}}/{{code}}
Referer: https://example.com/article
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone) AppleWebKit Chrome/120 Mobile
X-Country-Code: IR

### Read the last 30 days of analytics
GET {{host}}/api/links/{{code}}/analytics

### Read analytics for a date range (To is exclusive)
GET {{host}}/api/links/{{code}}/analytics?from=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z

### Deactivate a link
PUT {{host}}/api/links/{{code}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}
